0OM4qWtaGm9ATEr2ApchS1Wy1BA&oe=6AB52E6E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Tales Of Snails", "keywords": ["TalesofSnails", "TabletopVR", "Arcade", "TimeChallange", "Ctrlart"], "long_description": "Step into the quirky world of Tales of Snails, a tabletop VR adventure set in the shadows of America\u2019s Prohibition era. Hidden beneath the city, an old cellar becomes your stage as you guide a determined snail through a series of time-pressured challenges. Every level is packed with tricky obstacles, clever traps, and a race against the clock as you fight to bring your snail to the rescue.\n\nBlending the charm of a classic board game with the immersion of VR, Tales of Snails offers a unique mix of strategy, reflex, and atmosphere. The prohibition-themed setting adds a layer of mystery and style, with moody underground environments and a playful twist on survival.\n\nWhether you\u2019re chasing the fastest time, exploring every hidden corner, or simply enjoying the unlikely heroism of a snail, this game invites you to think fast, move carefully, and discover how slow can still win the race.\n\nFeatures:\n\n\ud83d\udc0c Tabletop VR adventure \u2013 Guide your snail hero through a miniature underground world.\n\n\u23f1 Race against time \u2013 Beat the clock as you overcome tricky obstacles and traps.\n\n\ud83c\udf78 Prohibition-era cellar \u2013 Explore moody, atmospheric environments inspired by the 1920s.\n\n\ud83c\udfb2 Board game feel in VR \u2013 A unique mix of puzzle strategy and immersive action.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Replay & master \u2013 Challenge yourself to rescue faster, smarter, and with style.\n", "short_description": "Tales of Snails is a fast-paced tabletop VR adventure where every second counts. Set in a mysterious underground cellar during the Prohibition era, you\u2019ll guide a determined snail through tricky obstacles, hidden traps, and time-pressured challenges. Race to complete levels, outsmart hazards, and bring your snail to the rescue in this unique blend of tension, charm, and old-time atmosphere."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ctrlart.com/privacy-policy-vr.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CtrlArt Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ctrlart.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29531778183104326"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 9, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1050149304452010"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2580240479045450"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2162223317861515"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "803030615576459"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1624374468923798"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1855986918392866"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2703525636679596"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1347343993736739"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1353366119680187"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2162223317861515"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1050149304452010"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "31763217926626996", "version": "0.1.4"}, "id": "2142340689615276", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binar